 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Use the selected PHP for analyzer scripts.** PHPStan, PHPCS and PHPMD script diagnostics use the editor-selected local interpreter for file and project analysis. Invalid selections report an error; native tools and custom launchers keep their own execution policy. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Generate members inside anonymous classes.** Constructor, accessor and inherited-method actions select the correct expression-owned class and preserve its surrounding code, inherited contracts and body layout. Interface extraction refuses anonymous owners even when resolving a retained action. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
